{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/locales/kr/17010380/document_597.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_17010380_597","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:597":{"text":"제발 좀 도와주세요!\n제 부주의로 사랑하는 <style=\"highlight\">흰 비둘기</style> <style=\"highlight\">세 마리</style>를 잃어버렸어요. 비둘기들은 돌아가신 할아버지께서 남겨 주신, 제 목숨보다도 소중한 추억이에요!\n비둘기의 다리에는 모두 <style=\"highlight\">쪽지</style>가 표식처럼 묶여 있어요. 혹시 비둘기들을 보신 분이 있다면 꼭 좀 연락해 주세요! 후하게 사례할게요!\n<align=\"right\">마음이 찢어지는 비둘기 주인","source_cn":"好心人，请帮帮我！\n本人不慎弄丢了<style=\"highlight\">三只</style>心爱的<style=\"highlight\">白鸽</style>，它们是我已故祖父留下的唯一念想，对我来说比生命还重要！\n三只白鸽的腿上都绑上了作为标记的<style=\"highlight\">纸条</style>，如果有谁见到了它们，请务必联系本人！本人必有重谢！\n<align=\"right\">心碎养鸽人","status":"matched","document_title":"반려동물을 찾습니다!","document_title_cn":"急寻爱宠！","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"easter_eggs/locales/kr/17010381/document_598.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_17010381_598","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:598":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">시장 계단 아래</style>","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">集市楼梯下</style>","status":"matched","document_title":"암호명: 비둘기","document_title_cn":"代号：鸽","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"easter_eggs/locales/kr/17010384/document_599.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_17010384_599","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:599":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">자정</style>","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">午夜零点</style>","status":"matched","document_title":"암호명: 비둘기","document_title_cn":"代号：鸽","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"easter_eggs/locales/kr/17010385/document_600.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_17010385_600","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:600":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">비둘기 울음소리 3번</style>","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">三声鸽子叫</style>","status":"matched","document_title":"암호명: 비둘기","document_title_cn":"代号：鸽","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"locales/kr/ep7/env_story/1737110